       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GLOBAL-OUTER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 GLOBAL-GROUP IS GLOBAL.
          05 GLOBAL-CHILD PIC X.
          05 STATUS-FIELD PIC X.
             88 STATUS-OK VALUE 'Y'.
       01 GLOBAL-TABLE IS GLOBAL.
          05 TABLE-ITEM OCCURS 10 TIMES
             INDEXED BY GLOBAL-IDX PIC X.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           GOBACK.

       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. GLOBAL-INNER.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 INNER-TARGET PIC X.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE GLOBAL-CHILD TO INNER-TARGET.
           IF STATUS-OK
               CONTINUE
           END-IF.
           MOVE TABLE-ITEM(GLOBAL-IDX) TO INNER-TARGET.
           GOBACK.
       END PROGRAM GLOBAL-INNER.
       END PROGRAM GLOBAL-OUTER.
